}}'''Huntik International HQ''' is the main headquarters of the [[Huntik Foundation]] where the [[Huntik Foundation Council]] meets to discuss the progress and problems of the [[Seeker]] world. This base is located in [[Manhattan, New York]].

== History ==
When Metz, the leader of the Council, fell victim to the [[Curse of the Legendary Titans]], the HQ hosted hologram meetings. {{source|Coming of Age}} However, following Metz' recovery, the Council members gathered in the HQ and started to deliberate again. {{Source|The Tower of Nostradamus}}

The Council discussed the reemergence of [[the Organization]] following the defeat of [[the Professor]]. [[Nasher]] then alerted the Council that his [[Seekers]] in [[Tower of Nostradamus]] had been attacked by [[the Organization]]. {{Source|The Tower of Nostradamus}}

When [[Focauld Casterwill]] alerted [[Teien Casterwill]] that the [[Blood Spiral]] had found him, Metz allowed her to bring the matter before the Council. {{source|The Casterwill Connection}} [[Dante]]'s team later came before the Council to discuss the Blood Spiral and were tasked with the mission [[Call of the Casterwill]]. {{source|The Titan in the Temple of Sun}}

The Council gathered in the International HQ on the longest night of the year to discuss plans to stop the activation of the [[Spiral Mark]]. {{source|Words from Eathon}} Several members, including [[Metz]], [[Momax]], [[Guggenheim]] and [[Teien]] fought during the final battle against the [[Blood Spiral]]. {{source|Dante's Return}}

Following the defeat of [[The Betrayer]], the Huntik Council gathered at the International HQ, now joined by a new member, [[Dante Vale]]. {{Source|Dante's Return}}
